   "t": "p",
   "html": "silver coins with the <a href=\"@minelab-equinox/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Minelab Equinox</a> some at Depth metal detecting east coast beach. some say the minelab Equinox has lost depth and the EQUINOX will not detect silver coins, i Found plenty of copper pre decimal coins, all using the deep setting for the <a href=\"@crawfords-metal-detectors/\" data-kind=\"internal\">minelab Equinox 800</a>, on the sand slope of the beach."
  },
